the next jaxlib release.","created_at":"2023-06-13T22:21:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/16286#issuecomment-1590131692","id":1590131692,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16286","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5ex3vs","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1590131692/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-06-13T22:21:01Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1590131692","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHere is an minimum example to reproduce the bug.\r\nTested using a single RTX 3090.\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\nfrom jax import jit, vmap\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\n\r\n@jit\r\ndef f(adj, mat):\r\n    return adj @ mat / jnp.sum(adj, axis=1)[:, jnp.newaxis]\r\n\r\nadj = jnp.ones((1024 * 100, 10, 10), dtype=bool)\r\nmat = jnp.ones((1024 * 100, 10, 100), dtype=float)\r\n\r\njax.jit(vmap(f))(adj, mat)\r\n```\r\nThe code will result in the following error when compiling:\r\n```bash\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/****/bug.py\", line 12, in <module>\r\n    jax.jit(vmap(f))(adj, mat)\r\njaxlib.xla_extension.XlaRuntimeError: INTERNAL: Failed to launch CUDA kernel: triton_gemm_dot_0 with block dimensions: 128x1x1 and grid dimensions: 4x1x102400 and shared memory size: 65536: CUDA_ERROR_INVALID_VALUE: invalid argument\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere adj is an adjacency matrix of type bool and mat is just a random matrix.\r\nSetting adj to float or avoid using `@` by using a combination of `vmap` and `jnp.sum` could solve this problem.\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\njax v0.4.11, jaxlib 0.4.11+cuda12.cudnn88\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nGPU\n\n### Additional system info\n\nPython 3.10, Linux\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n```\r\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| NVIDIA-SMI 530.41.03              Driver Version: 530.41.03    CUDA Version: 12.1     |\r\n|-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n| GPU  Name                  Persistence-M| Bus-Id        Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\r\n| Fan  Temp  Perf            Pwr:Usage/Cap|         Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\r\n|                                         |                      |               MIG M. |\r\n|=========================================+======================+======================|\r\n|   0  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090         Off| 00000000:17:00.0 Off |                  N/A |\r\n| 35%   36C    P8               27W / 350W|     19MiB / 24576MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                      |                  N/A |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   1  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090         Off| 00000000:B3:00.0 Off |                  N/A |\r\n| 37%   44C    P8               21W / 350W|      6MiB / 24576MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                      |                  N/A |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n\r\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| Processes:                                                                            |\r\n|  GPU   GI   CI        PID   Type   Process name                            GPU Memory |\r\n|        ID   ID                                                             Usage      |\r\n|=======================================================================================|\r\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n```","closed_at":"2023-06-13T22:21:01Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16286/comments","created_a